title: "atlasti-guided-coding: a Claude skill for guided qualitative coding in ATLAS.ti"
abstract: "A Claude skill for guided qualitative coding in ATLAS.ti over its MCP server: the assistant suggests codes verified against the live codebook, the researcher decides, and only approved quotations are written, with an on-disk audit trail."
